                <span class="hiw-cal__event-label">Next morning</span>
                <span class="hiw-cal__event-range">Loop begins again</span>
              </div>
              <p class="hiw-cal__event-text">Reports updated. Revenue logged. Overnight bookings already waiting. Repeat.</p>
            </div>

